            <ArticleTitle>Realizing Small Energy Loss of 0.55 eV, High Open-Circuit Voltage &gt;1 V and High Efficiency &gt;10% in Fullerene-Free Polymer Solar Cells via Energy Driver.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1002/adma.201605216</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A new, easy, and efficient approach is reported to enhance the driving force for charge transfer, break tradeoff between open-circuit voltage and short-circuit current, and simultaneously achieve very small energy loss (0.55 eV), very high open-circuit voltage (&gt;1 V), and very high efficiency (&gt;10%) in fullerene-free organic solar cells via an energy driver.</AbstractText>
